    },
    {
      "text": "Once finished, it should be soft to the touch but still slightly firm.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-creamy-cauliflower-mashed-potatoes/#wprm-recipe-51657-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/img_2154.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in the remaining ingredients except the chives.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-creamy-cauliflower-mashed-potatoes/#wprm-recipe-51657-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/img_2156.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use an immersion blender to pulse the cauliflower together with the other ingredients. Add in half of the chives and mix them in.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/easy-creamy-cauliflower-mashed-potatoes/#wprm-recipe-51657-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/img_2158.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with the remaining chives, serve, and enjoy!",
